Level: none
Status: LD
ED: https://arronei.github.io/CSS-Additions/date-media-queries/spec/
Repository: arronei/CSS-Additions
Editor: Arron Eicholz
Abstract: This specification adds media features and functions that test the current date and time:
    '@media/date', '@media/time', '@media/weekday', '@media/month', '@media/day', '@media/moon-phase',
    and '@media/season', plus the ''holiday()'' and ''calendar()'' functions. Dates and times are written
    as the ISO 8601 strings that Temporal parses, such as <code>"2026-09-09"</code>,
    <code>"--12-25"</code>, and <code>"18:00"</code>, so a style sheet can turn on a sale banner for one
    week, a winter theme every December, or a launch button at one moment worldwide, without script.
Markup Shorthands: markdown yes, css yes
Complain About: accidental-2119 no, missing-example-ids yes
Assume Explicit For: yes
